The HyenaDNA architecture and Biohub ESMC architecture/tokenizer behavior are
implemented from their public upstream specifications. Their model and code
licenses and use terms remain separate from evo.cpp's Apache-2.0 license.

The frozen GENEB benchmark specification metadata in
configs/geneb-benchmark-spec.json is reproduced from darlednik/GENEB commit
b54d018903e7f6b874ee45b74e275936deff4cd3, distributed under the Apache
License 2.0. Third-party model weights and their licenses remain separate.

BioNeMo NeMo2/Megatron Bridge checkpoint naming and the BF16-to-Vortex
conversion semantics are informed by NVIDIA BioNeMo Recipes, distributed
under the Apache License 2.0:
https://github.com/NVIDIA/bionemo-framework

Architecture and validation design also draw on public engineering techniques
documented by llama.cpp and ds4. No source code from those projects is included.

